#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:811
#, fuzzy
msgid "`wxplot_pngcairo` tells whether _wxMaxima_ tries to use _Gnuplot_’s pngcairo terminal that provides more line styles and a better overall graphics quality."
